From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alessandro Lopez <norelec@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 09:01:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Build the client, launcher and plugin host with NativeAOT
 scripts

- scripts/build.sh (dispatcher) and build-naot.sh build bin/dist on Windows
  (Git Bash), Linux and macOS: the client as a single NativeAOT executable, the
  launcher and the plugin host. ./ClassicUO starts the launcher. Files left by
  the old bootstrap and Mono hosts are removed from bin/dist; FNA.dll.config
  stays, Linux and macOS need it to find SDL3.
- scripts/make-macos-app.sh turns bin/dist into bin/ClassicUO.app, keeping
  settings.json and launcher.json as user data.
- scripts/README.md documents the build, the launcher and how plugins run.
- The client is a WinExe on Windows, so no console opens next to the game.
- The deploy workflow builds with the scripts, for osx-arm64 and linux-arm64
  as well; the solution lists the launcher, the plugin host and the scripts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LFcBNQtF3Z7vfzi99BXwUe
